&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;b6h97-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;b6h97-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;A love for process and an &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;popover-trigger-:rne:&quot; class=&quot;chakra-text css-8zk7oi&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;b6h97-1-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;understanding&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;b6h97-2-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt; of how to map out team processes/timelines, improve upon them, and iterate.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
