&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build the Future with Us — EquipmentShare is Hiring a Sales Manager&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At EquipmentShare, we’re not just filling a role — &lt;strong&gt;we’re assembling the best team on the planet to build something that’s never been built before&lt;/strong&gt;. We’re on a mission to transform an industry that’s been stuck in the past by empowering contractors and communities through innovative technology, real-time support, and a team that truly cares.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re hiring a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Sales Manager&lt;/strong&gt; at our rental facility in Phoenix, AZ and we’re looking for someone who’s ready to grow with us, bring energy and drive to their work, and help us build the future of construction.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Salary range: $110,000-$130,000/yr. Factors including past experience and location may affect final compensation rate.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Primary Responsibilities&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
