&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;SpaceX was founded under the belief that a future where humanity is out exploring the stars is fundamentally more exciting than one where we are not. Today SpaceX is actively developing the technologies to make this possible, with the ultimate goal of&amp;nbsp;enabling human life on Mars.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;OPERATIONS ENGINEER (SPACE PLANNING)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The Corporate Operations Engineering team supports overall business&amp;nbsp;operations&amp;nbsp;through strategic planning, optimization of processes, and alignment of resources to tasks. In this role, you will work with all programs on the Hawthorne campus to develop and&amp;nbsp;maintain&amp;nbsp;accurate&amp;nbsp;space allocations. You will be challenged to be up to date with space needs and timelines&amp;nbsp;in order to&amp;nbsp;help your stakeholders succeed. We are looking for an engineer with a history of managing multiple projects and providing creative solutions that will&amp;nbsp;optimize&amp;nbsp;operational efficiency. This position is based out of the Hawthorne campus and will require an active on-site presence.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;RESPONSIBILITIES:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Conduct operations engineering at a strategic level by&amp;nbsp;optimizing&amp;nbsp;resources, schedules, and risk under uncertainty&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Manage multiple concurrent projects and execute to tight timelines while effectively communicating to and influencing stakeholders&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Maintain accurate information and coordinate space planning decisions within and between campuses using a BIM or mapping software such as ArcGIS, Revit or similar&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Engage leadership and Operations Engineering teams&amp;nbsp;across&amp;nbsp;groups to&amp;nbsp;understand requirements,&amp;nbsp;synchronize&amp;nbsp;efforts&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;provide input into space strategy and&amp;nbsp;utilization&amp;nbsp;across the Hawthorne campus&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Own and&amp;nbsp;operate&amp;nbsp;a plan of record for&amp;nbsp;changes and trades across campus, including rationale, owners,&amp;nbsp;and timeline of events&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Create&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;operationalize&amp;nbsp;widespread&amp;nbsp;usage of standard&amp;nbsp;templates&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;facilitate&amp;nbsp;space requests,&amp;nbsp;increasing consistency and quality of rationale for requests&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Identify&amp;nbsp;operational challenges within the organization, lead problem formulation,&amp;nbsp;determine&amp;nbsp;root cause, and implement creative and effective solutions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Communicate effectively&amp;nbsp;with&amp;nbsp;different levels&amp;nbsp;of the organization, including everything from layout reviews with engineers to&amp;nbsp;presentations&amp;nbsp;with&amp;nbsp;upper leadership&lt;/span&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
