&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;317&quot; data-end=&quot;340&quot;&gt;Project Coordinator&lt;/strong&gt; to support the &lt;strong data-start=&quot;356&quot; data-end=&quot;385&quot;&gt;management and operations&lt;/strong&gt; of a digital platform. If you have a strong background in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;444&quot; data-end=&quot;513&quot;&gt;project coordination, service support, and stakeholder management&lt;/strong&gt;, we want to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4 data-start=&quot;571&quot; data-end=&quot;593&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;576&quot; data-end=&quot;591&quot;&gt;JOB SUMMARY&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;594&quot; data-end=&quot;817&quot;&gt;Digital Platform Operations Coordinator to support the management and development of our digital platform. The ideal candidate will have a strong background in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;754&quot; data-end=&quot;814&quot;&gt;project management, service support, and user experience&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;594&quot; data-end=&quot;817&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;946&quot; data-end=&quot;976&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;950&quot; data-end=&quot;974&quot;&gt;KEY RESPONSIBILITIES&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h4 data-start=&quot;978&quot; data-end=&quot;1020&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;983&quot; data-end=&quot;1018&quot;&gt;Business &amp;amp; Platform Operations:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1021&quot; data-end=&quot;1517&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1021&quot; data-end=&quot;1109&quot;&gt;Assist in business operations and coordination with training partners and customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1110&quot; data-end=&quot;1195&quot;&gt;Assist and coordinate with various divisions in daily operations and escalations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1196&quot; data-end=&quot;1249&quot;&gt;Monitor issues, work items, and their resolution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1250&quot; data-end=&quot;1302&quot;&gt;Participate in project implementation processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1303&quot; data-end=&quot;1382&quot;&gt;Develop and test cross-functional &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1339&quot; data-end=&quot;1379&quot;&gt;Standard Operating Procedures (SOPs)&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1383&quot; data-end=&quot;1457&quot;&gt;Create and maintain &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1405&quot; data-end=&quot;1454&quot;&gt;Business Continuity Planning (BCP) frameworks&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1458&quot; data-end=&quot;1517&quot;&gt;Establish and implement &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1484&quot; data-end=&quot;1514&quot;&gt;Risk Assessment frameworks&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4 data-start=&quot;1519&quot; data-end=&quot;1546&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1524&quot; data-end=&quot;1544&quot;&gt;Service Support:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1547&quot; data-end=&quot;1853&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1547&quot; data-end=&quot;1638&quot;&gt;Manage all tickets that are inbound for the platform as &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1605&quot; data-end=&quot;1635&quot;&gt;Level 1 resolution officer&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1639&quot; data-end=&quot;1703&quot;&gt;Implement and manage a &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1664&quot; data-end=&quot;1700&quot;&gt;SaaS/PaaS Service Support Centre&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1704&quot; data-end=&quot;1781&quot;&gt;Develop user-facing service support content for the platform and website.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1782&quot; data-end=&quot;1853&quot;&gt;Monitor &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1792&quot; data-end=&quot;1811&quot;&gt;support tickets&lt;/strong&gt; and ensure quality resolution delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4 data-start=&quot;1855&quot; data-end=&quot;1891&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1860&quot; data-end=&quot;1889&quot;&gt;Training &amp;amp; Documentation:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1892&quot; data-end=&quot;2048&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1892&quot; data-end=&quot;1987&quot;&gt;Assist in onboarding training service providers, shipping lines, and users to the platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1988&quot; data-end=&quot;2048&quot;&gt;Develop and maintain content related to user onboarding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;2050&quot; data-end=&quot;2074&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2054&quot; data-end=&quot;2072&quot;&gt;QUALIFICATIONS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2075&quot; data-end=&quot;2419&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2075&quot; data-end=&quot;2180&quot;&gt;3+ years of &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2089&quot; data-end=&quot;2127&quot;&gt;experience in project coordination&lt;/strong&gt;, preferably in a &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2145&quot; data-end=&quot;2177&quot;&gt;digital platform environment&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2181&quot; data-end=&quot;2253&quot;&gt;Experience with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2199&quot; data-end=&quot;2222&quot;&gt;SaaS/PaaS platforms&lt;/strong&gt; and service support systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2254&quot; data-end=&quot;2356&quot;&gt;Proficiency in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2271&quot; data-end=&quot;2313&quot;&gt;creating and maintaining documentation&lt;/strong&gt;, including &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2325&quot; data-end=&quot;2333&quot;&gt;SOPs&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2338&quot; data-end=&quot;2353&quot;&gt;user guides&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
